  "source_caveats": [
    "331 preserves publisher Gandhathūpiya and its BJTS-attributed chapter title versus the distinct VRI spellings and chapter label.",
    "331 chapter heading stays once in publisher_paratext; six-key publisher_preface is textless metadata/notes. Chapter note1 never enters poem notes2–4 or quotations.",
    "332–334 preserve fancy braces, literal asterisk, BJTS-only heading statements and heading-owned notes. Their absent local stanza numbers remain null.",
    "331 combined3–4/global2933–2934 and334 combined globals2951–2952 retain original eight-line physical entries.",
    "334 has20 publisher global labels versus19 VRI numbered stanzas, with differing partitions; no one-entry/one-line alignment or VRI wording supplementation is approved.",
    "334 note4 amendment statement and English/VRI number tension, note7 mixed quotation marks and note8 repeated-foot discussion remain exactly source-owned and unchanged. Specialist interpretation remains external.",
    "Cross-references to earlier or later publisher poems do not approve those sources or alternate canonical mappings.335 remains a boundary witness only."
  ],
